# Notes

Personal study notes on the Linux kernel, operating systems, and related
tooling. Continuously updated.

## Layout

```
.
├── os/                        # OS / kernel notes, scripts, configs and code
│   ├── code/                  # compile / linker lab code
│   │   └── compling_lab/      # *.{c,h,s,o,i} + makefile, static/shared/map/log
│   ├── config/                # editor / debugger configs (.gdbinit)
│   ├── markdown/              # notes written in Markdown
│   │   └── lwnweekly-report/  # LWN weekly hot-topic reports
│   ├── pdf/                   # PDF exports generated from Markdown
│   └── scripts/               # helper shell scripts
├── local/                     # local notes (separate git repo, not pushed)
├── vimrcbk                    # backup of my .vimrc
├── LICENSE                    # GPLv3
└── README
```

## Topics

The notes under `os/markdown/` cover, roughly:

- **Memory management** — `mm.md`, `hmm.md`, `cxl.md`, `IAA.md`, `QPL.md`,
  `swap_memory_reclaim.md`
- **Synchronization** — `linux_sync.md`, `rwlock_rcu.md`, `hazard_pointer.md`
- **Boot & linking** — `system_boot.md`, `pxe_ipxe.md`, `uefi.md`,
  `dynamic_link.md`, `linker.md`, `elf.md`, `execve.md`, `compile.md`,
  `systemV_abi.md`
- **Console & serial** — `console.md`, `8250uart.md`, `baud.md`, `early_prink.md`
- **Kernel tooling** — `strace.md`, `ftrace.md`, `build_debug_kernel.md`,
  `linuxlog.md`
- **C / toolchain** — `__attribute__.md`, `synopsis.md`
- **Editor & dev tooling** — `vimrc.md`, `vim-ai.md`, `vim-ai-config.md`,
  `ctags_cscope_index_guide.md`, `docker.md`, `scp.md`
- **Storage & systems** — `ridger_mimo.md`, `ftl.md`
- **LWN weekly** — `lwnweekly-report/` (weekly hot-topic reports)
- **Misc** — `chat.md`; `keyword.md` tracks topics to dig into next (CXL, famfs,
  HMM, DAX, memcg, tiered-memory, folio, THP, MMIO, IOMMU, ...).

## Code

`os/code/compling_lab/` is a small C lab used to study the compilation and
linking pipeline: `main.c` / `calc.c` / `calc.h` with generated `.i`, `.s`, `.o`,
static (`libcalc.a`, `elf_static`) and shared (`libcalc.so`, `elf_shared`)
artifacts, along with linker map files and a loader log.

## Scripts

| Script | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `os/scripts/md2pdf.sh` | Convert a Markdown file to PDF via Pandoc + XeLaTeX (CJK aware). Run `os/scripts/md2pdf.sh -h` for options. |
| `os/scripts/start-qemu.sh` | Boot a kernel + rootfs in QEMU (`bzImage` / `rootfs.ext2`), with `--serial-only` and `--use-system-qemu` modes. |
| `os/scripts/ubuntu2404.sh` | Create / reuse a per-user `ubuntu:24.04` Docker container for kernel builds. |

## Configs

- `os/config/.gdbinit` — GDB setup for debugging a Linux kernel over the QEMU
  gdbstub (`127.0.0.1:1234`), with TUI layouts and helper commands
  (`kcontext`, `kmodules`, `reconnect`).
- `vimrcbk` — my `.vimrc` (Vundle plugins, cscope integration, key mappings).

## Local notes

`local/` is a separate git repository for notes that stay on this machine
(work-in-progress bug investigations, internal tracker IDs). It is not pushed
and has its own README — see `local/README`.

